nvinced,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "I listen to others without much thought for me,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "I live my life like a student eternally,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Always ready to learn, even from my misdeeds."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}